# Copy to .dev.vars for local `npm run dev`. Do not commit .dev.vars.
# Production: `npx wrangler secret put BETTER_AUTH_SECRET`

# Also seals store tokens and carrier API keys at rest; change it and they must be pasted again or reconnected.
BETTER_AUTH_SECRET=replace-me-with-32-plus-random-chars
BETTER_AUTH_URL=http://localhost:5173

# Optional. Purchase-order send, password reset, and teammate invite.
# MAIL_API_KEY=
# MAIL_FROM=Rackline <floor@your-domain>

# Optional. Shopify OAuth (Install Shopify app). Pasting an Admin token works without these.
# SHOPIFY_API_KEY=
# SHOPIFY_API_SECRET=

# Optional. Live Etsy: your Etsy app's keystring turns on Connect Etsy shop and the receipt poll.
# Register http://localhost:5173/api/channels/etsy/oauth/callback as a callback URL in the Etsy app.
# Without it, Etsy orders come in by CSV and Send a sample order runs in demo.
# ETSY_API_KEY=
# Optional, with ETSY_API_KEY. The Etsy app's shared secret; when set, calls send keystring:shared_secret as x-api-key.
# ETSY_SHARED_SECRET=
